1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:01:30,070
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:01:30,340 --> 00:01:33,578
=Against The Current=

3
00:01:33,579 --> 00:01:35,000
(Adapted from He Yanshan's novel, Orchid Fragrance Fate)

4
00:01:35,180 --> 00:01:36,920
=Episode 38= (This drama does not correspond)

5
00:01:36,930 --> 00:01:38,200
(to any real historical dynasty.)

6
00:01:38,210 --> 00:01:41,160
(The systems, culture, attire and other dynastic elements have been adapted.)

7
00:01:43,200 --> 00:01:44,560
The Lin Residence is so large,

8
00:01:45,120 --> 00:01:46,079
and with the retreat,

9
00:01:46,424 --> 00:01:47,710
there are over a hundred people.

10
00:01:48,232 --> 00:01:50,328
We can't go without someone running the household.

11
00:01:55,959 --> 00:01:57,280
What you mean is...

12
00:01:59,040 --> 00:02:00,760
Xiulai, you're able to run a household,

13
00:02:01,144 --> 00:02:02,070
so the Lin Residence

14
00:02:02,599 --> 00:02:04,000
is in your hands to run.

15
00:02:06,359 --> 00:02:07,560
No, I can't.

16
00:02:08,159 --> 00:02:09,759
I'm separated and back with my family.

17
00:02:09,800 --> 00:02:12,240
If you don't mind me living off you, I'll be forever grateful.

18
00:02:12,310 --> 00:02:14,024
I'm in no position to run the household.

19
00:02:14,616 --> 00:02:16,000
You'll manage the household for me,

20
00:02:16,199 --> 00:02:17,759
and I'll pay you every month,

21
00:02:18,240 --> 00:02:20,000
and a share of profits if you do well.

22
00:02:20,400 --> 00:02:21,599
Then from now on,

23
00:02:21,599 --> 00:02:22,439
in the Lin Residence,

24
00:02:22,439 --> 00:02:24,319
you'll earn your keep on your own merit.

25
00:02:24,856 --> 00:02:25,560
That's right.

26
00:02:26,240 --> 00:02:27,319
Lanxiang is right.

27
00:02:27,680 --> 00:02:28,159
Xiulai...

28
00:02:28,159 --> 00:02:29,199
Stop making a fuss.

29
00:02:33,039 --> 00:02:33,520
Lanxiang,

30
00:02:34,240 --> 00:02:35,080
I really can't.

31
00:02:35,919 --> 00:02:38,280
Do you really want to live off the Lin family forever?

32
00:02:39,719 --> 00:02:40,560
Your dowry

33
00:02:40,560 --> 00:02:42,159
was squandered by the Lu family.

34
00:02:42,560 --> 00:02:44,639
Are you planning to remarry, then?

35
00:02:47,080 --> 00:02:48,240
I have no such intention.

36
00:02:49,520 --> 00:02:50,439
Yingzhi is still young.

37
00:02:50,856 --> 00:02:52,870
Once Jun returns, I'll have a son and a daughter.

38
00:02:53,400 --> 00:02:55,639
I just want to raise them well.

39
00:02:56,520 --> 00:02:57,879
I'll never remarry in this life.

40
00:02:58,960 --> 00:03:00,560
If you don't plan to remarry,

41
00:03:00,580 --> 00:03:02,150
then you'll live in the Lin Residence

42
00:03:02,184 --> 00:03:03,310
for the rest of your life.

43
00:03:04,400 --> 00:03:06,039
You may be willing to bite your tongue

44
00:03:06,080 --> 00:03:07,159
and tiptoe around everyone,

45
00:03:07,759 --> 00:03:09,560
but what about Yingzhi and Jun?

46
00:03:13,439 --> 00:03:14,680
Think further ahead.

47
00:03:15,879 --> 00:03:17,879
Jun's betrothal gifts when he marries,

48
00:03:18,319 --> 00:03:19,520
and Yingzhi's dowry...

49
00:03:20,240 --> 00:03:22,120
will those come from living off others?

50
00:03:35,800 --> 00:03:36,360
Lanxiang,

51
00:03:36,664 --> 00:03:38,400
it's not that Xiulai doesn't understand.

52
00:03:39,319 --> 00:03:40,639
But if she runs the household,

53
00:03:41,479 --> 00:03:42,639
she's bound to face gossip.

54
00:03:43,096 --> 00:03:44,750
Running the household may draw gossip,

55
00:03:45,400 --> 00:03:46,759
but it comes with real power.

56
00:03:47,560 --> 00:03:49,840
For the sake of their monthly allowance,

57
00:03:50,120 --> 00:03:51,719
they won't dare say it to her face.

58
00:03:52,159 --> 00:03:54,080
They'll only gossip behind her back.

59
00:03:55,120 --> 00:03:55,840
There's no way

60
00:03:56,088 --> 00:03:57,310
that a woman who dared to go

61
00:03:57,319 --> 00:03:59,159
to Shuntian Prefecture to sue for a separation

62
00:03:59,599 --> 00:04:01,199
would fear a few wagging tongues.

63
00:04:03,680 --> 00:04:04,400
Besides,

64
00:04:04,840 --> 00:04:06,150
people's hearts change easily.

65
00:04:06,919 --> 00:04:07,919
If you do well,

66
00:04:09,080 --> 00:04:11,599
they may be truly won over one day.

67
00:04:12,039 --> 00:04:13,080
Who knows?

68
00:04:15,479 --> 00:04:16,439
But Lanxiang,

69
00:04:18,632 --> 00:04:20,830
you're the wife of the Lin family's eldest grandson.

70
00:04:21,759 --> 00:04:22,879
By doing this,

71
00:04:23,160 --> 00:04:25,879
aren't you afraid the Old Master and First Madam will disapprove

72
00:04:26,120 --> 00:04:27,199
and punish you?

73
00:04:27,759 --> 00:04:28,639
Me?

74
00:04:34,279 --> 00:04:35,920
I've got thick skin.

75
00:04:37,600 --> 00:04:39,920
The Old Master and First Madam already dislike me.

76
00:04:40,399 --> 00:04:42,319
At worst, they'll dislike me even more.

77
00:04:42,800 --> 00:04:44,279
Anyway, they're in Jinling,

78
00:04:44,360 --> 00:04:45,560
too far away to reach us.

79
00:04:45,920 --> 00:04:46,879
We're in the capital,

80
00:04:47,240 --> 00:04:49,120
so let's enjoy ourselves while we can.

81
00:04:54,079 --> 00:04:54,680
Xiulai,

82
00:04:55,279 --> 00:04:56,839
we should learn from Lanxiang.

83
00:04:57,439 --> 00:05:00,279
This world has enough rules as it is.

84
00:05:01,600 --> 00:05:02,399
People

85
00:05:02,744 --> 00:05:04,240
should look after themselves first.

86
00:05:07,079 --> 00:05:08,120
Have you figured it out?

87
00:05:09,600 --> 00:05:11,279
Don't worry, Xiulai.

88
00:05:11,680 --> 00:05:13,160
Lanxiang never acts recklessly.

89
00:05:13,519 --> 00:05:15,079
She must have thought it through.

90
00:05:15,848 --> 00:05:17,000
If she dares to suggest it,

91
00:05:17,319 --> 00:05:18,439
just go ahead and do it.

92
00:05:19,120 --> 00:05:20,319
If the sky falls,

93
00:05:20,712 --> 00:05:21,680
we'll face it together.

94
00:05:38,560 --> 00:05:39,600
Starting today,

95
00:05:39,816 --> 00:05:42,040
the First Young Lady will manage the household for me.

96
00:05:43,600 --> 00:05:45,360
I have one reminder for you.

97
00:05:46,519 --> 00:05:48,560
We Lins are all one family.

98
00:05:49,959 --> 00:05:51,360
The First Young Lady is a Lin.

99
00:05:52,120 --> 00:05:54,399
The Young Master chose to take 200 strokes

100
00:05:54,920 --> 00:05:56,160
to protect her.

101
00:05:57,560 --> 00:05:59,160
If anyone thinks of bullying her,

102
00:06:00,279 --> 00:06:03,040
first consider whether the Young Master would allow it.

103
00:06:05,820 --> 00:06:10,820
♪Faded ink turns fragrant, spring rises and summer grows♪

104
00:06:10,820 --> 00:06:14,140
♪As if time itself were flowing♪

105
00:06:14,140 --> 00:06:17,620
♪Pausing, then rewinding♪

106
00:06:21,399 --> 00:06:22,879
I know some of the nannies

107
00:06:23,199 --> 00:06:25,560
and stewards are longtime servants here,

108
00:06:26,279 --> 00:06:27,519
and are well respected.

109
00:06:29,112 --> 00:06:31,360
But since I've promised Lanxiang to run the household,

110
00:06:32,160 --> 00:06:33,959
I have my own respect to uphold.

111
00:06:35,160 --> 00:06:37,000
From now on, if you respect me,

112
00:06:37,959 --> 00:06:39,439
I'll rely on you in return.

113
00:06:41,040 --> 00:06:42,720
But if you use your seniority

114
00:06:43,120 --> 00:06:44,439
to do something shameful,

115
00:06:45,279 --> 00:06:47,680
as a junior, I can't punish you myself.

116
00:06:48,456 --> 00:06:50,830
I'll just tie you up and bring you before the Old Master,

117
00:06:51,279 --> 00:06:52,040
the Old Madam,

118
00:06:52,720 --> 00:06:54,079
the Master and First Madam,

119
00:06:54,536 --> 00:06:56,070
and let them decide your punishment.

120
00:06:57,976 --> 00:06:59,310
Rest assured, First Young Lady.

121
00:06:59,759 --> 00:07:02,120
We'd never dare to abuse our seniority.

122
00:07:02,900 --> 00:07:05,860
♪I watch the passing years wear away♪

123
00:07:05,860 --> 00:07:09,140
♪Even deep affection slowly fades♪

124
00:07:09,540 --> 00:07:16,340
♪The past falls like withered leaves into the dust♪

125
00:07:17,439 --> 00:07:19,000
Lanxiang is truly one of a kind.

126
00:07:19,920 --> 00:07:22,240
She even thought of having Xiulai run the household.

127
00:07:23,944 --> 00:07:25,190
At first, it seems unreasonable,

128
00:07:25,600 --> 00:07:27,600
but on reflection, it's perfectly sound.

129
00:07:29,240 --> 00:07:30,839
Remarkable people do remarkable things.

130
00:07:31,759 --> 00:07:33,800
No wonder you took a slap back then

131
00:07:34,040 --> 00:07:35,240
just to marry her.

132
00:07:42,600 --> 00:07:44,160
Stop teasing me.

133
00:07:44,879 --> 00:07:46,120
More importantly, your health...

134
00:07:46,600 --> 00:07:47,480
how is it?

135
00:07:48,399 --> 00:07:49,800
I heard that today

136
00:07:50,040 --> 00:07:51,319
you sent for a physician.

137
00:07:54,519 --> 00:07:55,600
I have good news

138
00:07:55,959 --> 00:07:57,839
to share with you and Lanxiang.

139
00:08:00,000 --> 00:08:00,439
All right.

140
00:08:01,279 --> 00:08:02,120
I'm all ears.

141
00:08:04,759 --> 00:08:05,800
Suhua is with child.

142
00:08:08,120 --> 00:08:08,959
You mean

143
00:08:11,160 --> 00:08:12,319
you're going to be a father?

144
00:08:15,959 --> 00:08:16,759
Wonderful.

145
00:08:17,279 --> 00:08:18,079
Congratulations.

146
00:08:18,720 --> 00:08:19,959
If the Old Master finds out,

147
00:08:20,319 --> 00:08:21,360
he'll be overjoyed.

148
00:08:21,800 --> 00:08:22,839
Write a letter right away,

149
00:08:22,840 --> 00:08:24,110
and I'll have it sent to Jinling.

150
00:08:24,120 --> 00:08:24,680
Jinqi.

151
00:08:28,319 --> 00:08:29,720
I'd like to ask you a favor.

152
00:08:30,600 --> 00:08:32,120
Don't tell anyone in Jinling yet.

153
00:08:35,559 --> 00:08:37,759
You don't want Concubine Zhou to know?

154
00:08:40,120 --> 00:08:41,320
Ever since I was born,

155
00:08:42,000 --> 00:08:43,600
Mother has cared for me devotedly.

156
00:08:45,120 --> 00:08:49,120
She kept watch over what I wore, what I ate, and how I slept.

157
00:08:51,039 --> 00:08:52,399
Nagged me constantly,

158
00:08:54,080 --> 00:08:55,000
"You're in poor health.

159
00:08:56,000 --> 00:08:57,960
You can't do this, and you can't do that."

160
00:09:00,600 --> 00:09:02,080
It was almost suffocating.

161
00:09:04,080 --> 00:09:04,879
I thought

162
00:09:05,360 --> 00:09:06,799
things would improve after I married,

163
00:09:08,200 --> 00:09:10,240
but Mother watched Suhua closely, too.

164
00:09:11,799 --> 00:09:13,200
Mother kept blaming Suhua

165
00:09:13,200 --> 00:09:14,799
for years of marriage without a child.

166
00:09:16,080 --> 00:09:17,080
But Suhua

167
00:09:18,080 --> 00:09:19,159
was so frightened by Mother

168
00:09:19,208 --> 00:09:20,750
that even staying with me a bit longer,

169
00:09:21,399 --> 00:09:23,080
she feared it would drain my vitality.

170
00:09:24,559 --> 00:09:25,759
How could she get pregnant?

171
00:09:30,200 --> 00:09:33,120
Concubine Zhou was only worried about your health.

172
00:09:37,759 --> 00:09:38,919
Now that I'm in the capital,

173
00:09:40,559 --> 00:09:42,960
without Mother shadowing my every move,

174
00:09:45,159 --> 00:09:46,279
I finally feel

175
00:09:48,519 --> 00:09:49,600
truly alive.

176
00:09:51,679 --> 00:09:52,759
Unfilial son that I am,

177
00:09:53,559 --> 00:09:54,480
I've grown too fond of

178
00:09:55,399 --> 00:09:57,080
this feeling of truly living.

179
00:10:00,919 --> 00:10:02,399
I really don't want Mother to come.

180
00:10:08,039 --> 00:10:08,720
All right.

181
00:10:09,679 --> 00:10:11,720
I'll keep this from them for you,

182
00:10:12,104 --> 00:10:13,750
and not let our elders in Jinling know.

183
00:10:15,879 --> 00:10:18,279
Thank you and Lanxiang for covering for me.

184
00:10:20,720 --> 00:10:22,039
Lanxiang isn't here,

185
00:10:22,159 --> 00:10:23,159
so your flattery

186
00:10:23,799 --> 00:10:24,720
is wasted.

187
00:10:29,320 --> 00:10:31,080
You've been married for over a year,

188
00:10:31,480 --> 00:10:32,960
yet still living in this warm chamber.

189
00:10:36,799 --> 00:10:37,840
Is it still the bitter part

190
00:10:38,320 --> 00:10:39,240
before the sweet?

191
00:10:44,840 --> 00:10:46,000
(Our ways)

192
00:10:47,080 --> 00:10:47,879
(differ.)

193
00:10:50,480 --> 00:10:51,120
Jinlan,

194
00:10:51,800 --> 00:10:53,940
those who follow different ways cannot plan together.

195
00:10:54,440 --> 00:10:55,279
What is the Way?

196
00:10:56,248 --> 00:10:57,360
The Way that can be spoken

197
00:10:58,080 --> 00:10:59,000
is not the eternal Way.

198
00:11:01,448 --> 00:11:02,870
That's too big a question, Jinqi.

199
00:11:03,159 --> 00:11:05,080
I can't think of how to answer.

200
00:11:05,570 --> 00:11:06,759
The Way of the gentleman is to

201
00:11:07,320 --> 00:11:11,360
cultivate oneself, order the family, govern the state, and pacify the realm.

202
00:11:12,080 --> 00:11:12,840
Is that wrong?

203
00:11:14,519 --> 00:11:16,679
You just quelled Prince Han's rebellion,

204
00:11:17,000 --> 00:11:19,200
bringing peace and well-being to all.

205
00:11:19,919 --> 00:11:21,039
What you've done

206
00:11:21,159 --> 00:11:23,720
leaves you no shame before Heaven or mankind.

207
00:11:23,736 --> 00:11:24,850
It is surely the right Way.

208
00:11:27,159 --> 00:11:29,279
Now just wait for His Majesty's reward.

209
00:11:31,460 --> 00:11:32,980
(Deep Roots, Lasting Grace)

210
00:11:32,980 --> 00:11:35,460
(Six Months Later)

211
00:11:35,460 --> 00:11:37,660
(Deep Roots, Lasting Grace)

212
00:11:38,240 --> 00:11:41,799
By the mandate of Heaven, the Emperor decrees.

213
00:11:42,600 --> 00:11:47,240
Lin Jinqi, Assistant Commander of the Central Military Command,

214
00:11:47,879 --> 00:11:49,960
when traitors rebelled,

215
00:11:50,320 --> 00:11:53,080
you were charged to defend the capital.

216
00:11:53,480 --> 00:11:55,799
With keen and decisive judgment,

217
00:11:56,080 --> 00:11:58,639
you defeated the enemy and prevailed.

218
00:11:59,600 --> 00:12:02,840
We hereby confer upon you the title of Guardian Serving Heaven's Mandate,

219
00:12:03,080 --> 00:12:05,200
Loyal and Dedicated Military Minister,

220
00:12:05,784 --> 00:12:07,864
Specially Promoted Grand Master of

221
00:12:07,870 --> 00:12:10,150
Glorious Emolument, Right Pillar of State,

222
00:12:10,639 --> 00:12:13,279
Left Chief Commander of the Rear Military Command,

223
00:12:13,519 --> 00:12:14,799
and Marquis Jing'an.

224
00:12:15,320 --> 00:12:19,120
Xu, wife of Lin Jinqi, Marquis Jing'an,

225
00:12:19,480 --> 00:12:20,910
in a time of peril for the realm,

226
00:12:21,200 --> 00:12:22,720
remained unwavering in resolve

227
00:12:23,039 --> 00:12:24,519
and upheld virtue in practice.

228
00:12:25,200 --> 00:12:28,919
She is hereby granted the title of Marchioness Jing'an.

229
00:12:29,000 --> 00:12:33,000
Receive this grace with reverence and forever grace your household.

230
00:12:33,816 --> 00:12:35,112
Your Majesty is most gracious.

231
00:12:35,399 --> 00:12:37,840
I would give my life to repay it.

232
00:12:37,960 --> 00:12:39,960
Thanks Your Majesty for this grace.

233
00:13:08,840 --> 00:13:10,720
Great news!

234
00:13:10,720 --> 00:13:11,759
(Glorify the Family Name)

235
00:13:11,759 --> 00:13:12,600
Great news!

236
00:13:13,480 --> 00:13:14,399
Great news!

237
00:13:15,360 --> 00:13:17,600
Wonderful news!

238
00:13:18,559 --> 00:13:20,440
Old Master, Old Madam,

239
00:13:20,799 --> 00:13:22,679
our Young Master crushed the rebellion,

240
00:13:22,759 --> 00:13:24,720
and His Majesty made him Marquis Jing'an

241
00:13:25,120 --> 00:13:27,440
and Left Chief Commander of the Rear Military Command!

242
00:13:28,639 --> 00:13:32,240
The Young Madam was named Marchioness Jing'an!

243
00:13:33,360 --> 00:13:34,759
Is the news certain?

244
00:13:34,960 --> 00:13:36,559
Yes, it's certain.

245
00:13:36,960 --> 00:13:39,200
Marquis Yuan told me himself.

246
00:13:39,759 --> 00:13:40,759
Marquis Jing'an...

247
00:13:41,759 --> 00:13:42,759
Marquis Jing'an...

248
00:13:42,919 --> 00:13:45,120
I'm the father of Marquis Jing'an!

249
00:13:46,399 --> 00:13:47,759
By custom,

250
00:13:48,120 --> 00:13:49,279
when a son is ennobled,

251
00:13:49,279 --> 00:13:52,039
he should petition His Majesty to grant titles to his parents,

252
00:13:52,360 --> 00:13:54,879
no lower in rank than his own.

253
00:13:55,879 --> 00:13:58,960
Then I'll be a marquis, too!

254
00:14:00,120 --> 00:14:02,679
And you'll be a marchioness.

255
00:14:04,120 --> 00:14:05,840
It's only an honorary title.

256
00:14:06,200 --> 00:14:08,240
Nothing more than a name.

257
00:14:09,039 --> 00:14:10,960
Shunhua!

258
00:14:11,399 --> 00:14:12,279
Did you hear?

259
00:14:12,559 --> 00:14:14,480
You're going to be a marchioness!

260
00:14:17,799 --> 00:14:18,759
Did you hear?

261
00:14:18,760 --> 00:14:21,448
(Cheng Fengxian, Lin Jinqiao's Wife) Your sister-in-law is a marchioness now.

262
00:14:22,120 --> 00:14:22,879
That's right.

263
00:14:23,159 --> 00:14:25,200
My eldest brother is Marquis Jing'an now.

264
00:14:28,248 --> 00:14:29,240
The Marquis also said

265
00:14:29,310 --> 00:14:30,900
His Majesty has issued a special decree.

266
00:14:30,919 --> 00:14:33,120
Jiugao and Nanke may leave bonded status.

267
00:14:33,320 --> 00:14:36,960
Jiugao is named company commander, and Nanke deputy company commander!

268
00:14:38,552 --> 00:14:39,870
Congratulations, Your Lordship.

269
00:14:40,279 --> 00:14:41,720
Congratulations, Marchioness.

270
00:14:41,736 --> 00:14:42,960
Thank you, Chief Steward Wang,

271
00:14:43,080 --> 00:14:44,320
for coming in person.

272
00:14:44,840 --> 00:14:46,519
Getting to share in the joy

273
00:14:47,000 --> 00:14:48,639
is my good fortune.

274
00:14:50,159 --> 00:14:51,480
In quelling this rebellion,

275
00:14:53,159 --> 00:14:54,919
Jiugao and Nanke

276
00:14:55,480 --> 00:14:57,240
also rendered great service.

277
00:14:57,960 --> 00:14:59,320
The Marquis submitted a memorial

278
00:14:59,320 --> 00:15:01,120
requesting rewards for them,

279
00:15:01,360 --> 00:15:02,919
and His Majesty has approved it.

280
00:15:16,960 --> 00:15:20,639
Amitabha.

281
00:15:21,159 --> 00:15:22,080
Old Master,

282
00:15:22,360 --> 00:15:24,200
even the Lin family's servants

283
00:15:24,280 --> 00:15:25,670
have made something of themselves.

284
00:15:26,679 --> 00:15:27,720
Marquis Jing'an...

285
00:15:30,120 --> 00:15:31,440
Old Master, Old Madam,

286
00:15:31,840 --> 00:15:32,679
although

287
00:15:32,960 --> 00:15:35,320
the clan has precedents for celebratory rites,

288
00:15:35,519 --> 00:15:37,960
the clan has never had a marquis.

289
00:15:38,399 --> 00:15:39,320
For now, I'm at a loss

290
00:15:39,519 --> 00:15:40,960
as to how to arrange it.

291
00:15:41,200 --> 00:15:42,879
Please, Old Master and Old Madam,

292
00:15:42,960 --> 00:15:44,039
make the decision.

293
00:15:45,559 --> 00:15:46,639
Then invite

294
00:15:47,399 --> 00:15:49,600
the clan elders over to discuss it

295
00:15:50,000 --> 00:15:51,039
and settle on a plan.

296
00:15:51,480 --> 00:15:51,879
Good.

297
00:15:51,879 --> 00:15:52,320
Very good.

298
00:15:52,399 --> 00:15:53,039
Very good.

299
00:15:54,279 --> 00:15:54,960
Good.

300
00:15:55,480 --> 00:15:57,440
This is truly wonderful news!

301
00:16:00,200 --> 00:16:00,879
Wonderful!

302
00:16:09,864 --> 00:16:10,200
Old...

303
00:16:10,360 --> 00:16:11,000
Old Madam!

304
00:16:13,120 --> 00:16:13,759
Old Madam!

305
00:16:16,480 --> 00:16:17,720
- Mother! - What do we do?

306
00:16:17,799 --> 00:16:18,320
What do we do?

307
00:16:18,320 --> 00:16:19,360
- Mother! - Mother!

308
00:16:19,360 --> 00:16:19,960
What's wrong?

309
00:16:20,039 --> 00:16:21,279
Mother, what's wrong?

310
00:16:21,279 --> 00:16:22,720
Stop! Don't move her!

311
00:16:22,720 --> 00:16:24,240
Stand aside. Don't get in the way!

312
00:16:24,440 --> 00:16:25,240
Mother!

313
00:16:26,200 --> 00:16:27,840
Huaixiang, fetch a basin of hot water.

314
00:16:28,159 --> 00:16:30,799
Mother, are you all right?

315
00:16:31,440 --> 00:16:32,960
Madam Wu, get the medicine chest.

316
00:16:32,984 --> 00:16:34,480
Huaixiang, fetch a basin of hot water!

317
00:16:34,480 --> 00:16:35,600
Hurry!

318
00:16:38,360 --> 00:16:39,039
Yinchen!

319
00:16:40,000 --> 00:16:40,399
Hurry.

320
00:16:40,600 --> 00:16:41,159
Go, quickly.

321
00:16:41,279 --> 00:16:42,240
My stomach hurts.

322
00:16:42,600 --> 00:16:43,440
Jinqiao!

323
00:16:43,480 --> 00:16:44,600
My stomach hurts!

324
00:16:44,600 --> 00:16:45,679
The baby's coming.

325
00:16:45,679 --> 00:16:47,639
Why did it have to happen now?

326
00:16:49,080 --> 00:16:49,870
Call the midwife!

327
00:16:49,960 --> 00:16:50,720
My stomach hurts.

328
00:16:50,720 --> 00:16:51,639
I'll fetch a physician!

329
00:16:55,336 --> 00:16:56,720
What are you standing there for?

330
00:16:56,799 --> 00:16:57,919
Help your wife, quickly!

331
00:16:59,519 --> 00:17:00,000
Careful.

332
00:17:00,639 --> 00:17:02,200
Careful...

333
00:17:09,680 --> 00:17:10,279
Lanxiang,

334
00:17:11,079 --> 00:17:12,359
here are this month's accounts.

335
00:17:12,359 --> 00:17:15,380
(Harmonious Joy)

336
00:17:17,039 --> 00:17:18,400
263 taels.

337
00:17:19,640 --> 00:17:21,400
Such a large surplus this month?

338
00:17:22,720 --> 00:17:24,039
Xiulai, you're truly capable.

339
00:17:29,480 --> 00:17:30,640
Besides the accounts,

340
00:17:30,776 --> 00:17:31,920
there's something important

341
00:17:31,920 --> 00:17:33,079
I'd like to discuss with you.

342
00:17:34,480 --> 00:17:34,960
Go ahead.

343
00:17:36,799 --> 00:17:39,039
Jinqi now serves His Majesty directly,

344
00:17:39,599 --> 00:17:41,400
so you're sure to stay in the capital.

345
00:17:42,200 --> 00:17:43,200
I was thinking

346
00:17:43,272 --> 00:17:44,680
we could buy, here in the capital,

347
00:17:44,728 --> 00:17:45,750
some land and houses.

348
00:17:47,079 --> 00:17:48,240
We may not need them now,

349
00:17:48,680 --> 00:17:50,200
but once there are children,

350
00:17:50,296 --> 00:17:51,640
for weddings and dowries alike,

351
00:17:51,688 --> 00:17:52,590
they'll come in handy.

352
00:17:54,400 --> 00:17:55,599
You make a good point, Xiulai.

353
00:17:56,799 --> 00:17:58,079
But first,

354
00:17:58,480 --> 00:18:01,160
land and houses here are very costly.

355
00:18:01,640 --> 00:18:03,039
We may not be able to afford them.

356
00:18:03,720 --> 00:18:06,359
Second, the capital is only so big.

357
00:18:06,720 --> 00:18:08,599
Land and houses are limited.

358
00:18:09,039 --> 00:18:10,039
We can't just buy them

359
00:18:10,039 --> 00:18:11,279
because we want to.

360
00:18:11,839 --> 00:18:13,000
You're right,

361
00:18:13,279 --> 00:18:15,279
but you forget the rebellion last year.

362
00:18:16,200 --> 00:18:17,720
Many families met with disaster.

363
00:18:18,160 --> 00:18:19,599
Their houses and land

364
00:18:19,600 --> 00:18:21,000
have gradually come on the market.

365
00:18:21,319 --> 00:18:21,920
Now

366
00:18:22,279 --> 00:18:23,839
is a good time to buy.

367
00:18:25,519 --> 00:18:26,160
That's right.

368
00:18:26,799 --> 00:18:27,920
How could I forget?

369
00:18:28,680 --> 00:18:30,960
The Zhao and Dai families alone

370
00:18:30,960 --> 00:18:32,440
had plenty of land and houses.

371
00:18:34,680 --> 00:18:36,640
Xiulai, you truly are a born manager.

372
00:18:37,359 --> 00:18:39,240
There's no better time than now

373
00:18:39,359 --> 00:18:40,559
to buy land and property.

374
00:18:41,079 --> 00:18:42,000
I've asked around.

375
00:18:42,319 --> 00:18:44,480
The families of Grand Secretary Xie and Duke Ying

376
00:18:44,720 --> 00:18:46,599
want 1,000 mu of fertile farmland.

377
00:18:47,240 --> 00:18:49,440
And the Eldest Prince's Eunuch Wang

378
00:18:49,680 --> 00:18:51,160
and the Second Prince's Eunuch Gao

379
00:18:51,279 --> 00:18:53,359
also want over 1,000 mu each.

380
00:18:54,640 --> 00:18:56,240
Are eunuchs really that rich?

381
00:18:56,680 --> 00:18:59,279
They can buy that much at once?

382
00:19:00,680 --> 00:19:02,759
These eunuchs have no wives or children,

383
00:19:03,000 --> 00:19:04,559
and their food and clothes are provided.

384
00:19:05,119 --> 00:19:07,400
What would they want so much land for?

385
00:19:08,440 --> 00:19:09,720
Xiulai, do you know

386
00:19:10,400 --> 00:19:11,920
why Cao Cao's surname was Cao?

387
00:19:14,559 --> 00:19:17,680
Supposedly, Cao Cao was born a Xiahou,

388
00:19:18,319 --> 00:19:19,759
but because his father

389
00:19:19,920 --> 00:19:21,799
was adopted by the eunuch lord Cao Teng,

390
00:19:22,079 --> 00:19:23,759
the name was changed to Cao.

391
00:19:27,720 --> 00:19:28,880
How foolish of me.

392
00:19:29,279 --> 00:19:30,880
Eunuchs can have heirs, too.

393
00:19:31,359 --> 00:19:32,920
Of course land would be of great use.

394
00:19:35,000 --> 00:19:36,039
We women

395
00:19:36,039 --> 00:19:37,039
don't need that much,

396
00:19:37,480 --> 00:19:38,680
but it's a rare opportunity.

397
00:19:39,000 --> 00:19:39,960
If we pool our money,

398
00:19:40,119 --> 00:19:41,759
we can surely buy 100-200 mu.

399
00:19:42,799 --> 00:19:44,000
It'd bring in income

400
00:19:44,359 --> 00:19:46,359
and could be left to the children later.

401
00:19:53,599 --> 00:19:55,279
I have some private savings.

402
00:19:56,039 --> 00:19:58,119
If there's land at a fair price,

403
00:19:58,359 --> 00:19:59,519
could I join in

404
00:19:59,680 --> 00:20:01,119
and buy some for the child?

405
00:20:02,000 --> 00:20:03,400
Suhua, why so formal?

406
00:20:04,039 --> 00:20:05,319
We're looking anyway.

407
00:20:05,640 --> 00:20:07,119
We can ask Xiulai

408
00:20:07,160 --> 00:20:08,839
to look with Second Butler Yang,

409
00:20:09,680 --> 00:20:11,519
and then have Lanxiang give final approval.

410
00:20:13,559 --> 00:20:14,559
Exactly.

411
00:20:15,279 --> 00:20:16,759
If we all buy together,

412
00:20:17,039 --> 00:20:18,279
we can look out for each other.

413
00:20:21,480 --> 00:20:23,599
I don't object if you want to buy,

414
00:20:24,119 --> 00:20:25,119
but I won't.

415
00:20:31,559 --> 00:20:33,400
Lanxiang, is your dowry not enough?

416
00:20:34,359 --> 00:20:34,920
I have money.

417
00:20:35,240 --> 00:20:36,359
Take it and use it.

418
00:20:37,720 --> 00:20:39,799
I have enough money for the land.

419
00:20:39,960 --> 00:20:40,519
Then...

420
00:20:40,920 --> 00:20:42,359
Did I not think it through?

421
00:20:42,680 --> 00:20:44,400
Did I get something wrong?

422
00:20:45,240 --> 00:20:46,519
No, you're not wrong, Xiulai.

423
00:20:47,240 --> 00:20:48,000
Right now

424
00:20:48,279 --> 00:20:48,920
is indeed

425
00:20:48,920 --> 00:20:50,960
a good time to acquire land and houses.

426
00:20:54,328 --> 00:20:55,720
If the Young Master wants to buy,

427
00:20:55,960 --> 00:20:57,640
let him vet it for you.

428
00:20:57,960 --> 00:20:59,160
I'll stay out of it.

429
00:21:04,319 --> 00:21:05,759
If Lanxiang isn't buying,

430
00:21:06,759 --> 00:21:07,920
then neither will I.

431
00:21:09,680 --> 00:21:11,799
I have no wish to marry now.

432
00:21:12,359 --> 00:21:14,039
As long as I have enough to live on,

433
00:21:14,359 --> 00:21:15,559
anything more is wasted.

434
00:21:16,759 --> 00:21:18,119
Then I won't buy either.

435
00:21:19,559 --> 00:21:20,799
The Second Young Master and I

436
00:21:20,800 --> 00:21:22,376
will surely return to Jinling someday.

437
00:21:23,200 --> 00:21:25,640
Buying land and houses in the capital

438
00:21:26,240 --> 00:21:27,440
really doesn't make sense.

439
00:21:29,240 --> 00:21:30,599
I don't have money anyway.

440
00:21:31,119 --> 00:21:33,599
I was just offering ideas

441
00:21:33,839 --> 00:21:34,799
and joining in the fun.

442
00:21:36,240 --> 00:21:37,519
Since none of you is buying,

443
00:21:39,519 --> 00:21:41,599
forget I brought it up.

444
00:22:05,160 --> 00:22:06,359
Different ways again...

445
00:22:08,559 --> 00:22:10,039
Lanxiang must miss her parents

446
00:22:10,519 --> 00:22:11,720
and want to go back to Jinling.

447
00:22:12,168 --> 00:22:13,720
That's why she won't buy property here.

448
00:22:28,119 --> 00:22:30,000
Xiuwan's clothes are just for show.

449
00:22:30,000 --> 00:22:31,240
Appreciate the thought,

450
00:22:31,519 --> 00:22:32,960
but never let the baby wear them.

451
00:22:35,559 --> 00:22:37,160
Jinqi, you're such a tease.

452
00:22:37,359 --> 00:22:38,759
I made them for fun.

453
00:22:39,440 --> 00:22:40,559
Suhua, you're with child.

454
00:22:40,759 --> 00:22:42,440
No need to stand. Please sit.

455
00:22:43,680 --> 00:22:45,119
Why did you come together?

456
00:22:47,240 --> 00:22:48,319
A letter came from Jinling.

457
00:22:49,079 --> 00:22:50,559
Jinqiao's wife had a son.

458
00:22:50,960 --> 00:22:52,240
Jinqiao is a father now.

459
00:22:54,160 --> 00:22:55,680
So Mother has a grandson.

460
00:22:56,359 --> 00:22:58,079
No wonder she never came to the capital

461
00:22:58,079 --> 00:22:58,920
to cause me trouble.

462
00:23:09,920 --> 00:23:11,240
There's other news from home?

463
00:23:14,920 --> 00:23:16,119
The Old Madam had a stroke.

464
00:23:17,519 --> 00:23:19,960
Fortunately, with careful treatment,

465
00:23:20,319 --> 00:23:21,559
her life is no longer in danger.

466
00:23:23,599 --> 00:23:24,839
But she has trouble moving,

467
00:23:25,000 --> 00:23:27,440
and her speech isn't as clear as before.

468
00:23:28,960 --> 00:23:30,240
Do we need to go back?

469
00:23:31,960 --> 00:23:34,119
The Old Master wants us in the capital,

470
00:23:34,480 --> 00:23:36,079
with no need to worry about home.

471
00:23:38,799 --> 00:23:40,720
But Aunt Lingxiao, as a daughter-in-law,

472
00:23:41,119 --> 00:23:42,720
must stay and tend to her.

473
00:23:43,160 --> 00:23:44,359
For the next year or so,

474
00:23:44,552 --> 00:23:46,104
she likely won't come to the capital.

475
00:23:50,984 --> 00:23:52,350
But in her letter, Aunt Lingxiao

476
00:23:52,440 --> 00:23:53,790
urged you to return to Jinling.

477
00:23:55,160 --> 00:23:55,799
She said

478
00:23:56,480 --> 00:23:58,039
now that Jinqi is Marquis Jing'an,

479
00:23:58,184 --> 00:24:00,760
the family can't bear to see you marry so far away in the capital,

480
00:24:00,776 --> 00:24:02,648
and wants to find you a good match in Jinling.

481
00:24:03,400 --> 00:24:04,599
I'm not going back.

482
00:24:05,599 --> 00:24:06,279
I won't.

483
00:24:08,240 --> 00:24:09,200
Jinqi, just tell her

484
00:24:09,480 --> 00:24:11,240
there are many fine young men here,

485
00:24:11,680 --> 00:24:13,599
that you and Lanxiang are matchmaking,

486
00:24:13,880 --> 00:24:15,759
so Mother needn't worry about my match.

487
00:24:16,559 --> 00:24:18,759
Lying to deceive our elders for you?

488
00:24:18,920 --> 00:24:19,799
I won't do that.

489
00:24:21,400 --> 00:24:22,480
And don't use Lanxiang

490
00:24:22,480 --> 00:24:23,640
as your shield.

491
00:24:23,720 --> 00:24:25,000
When Aunt Lingxiao makes a scene,

492
00:24:25,000 --> 00:24:27,200
even I can't fend off her volleys.

493
00:24:28,640 --> 00:24:29,599
Just kidding.

494
00:24:29,960 --> 00:24:32,160
The Old Master's letter never even mentioned you.

495
00:24:34,519 --> 00:24:35,440
Jinlan!

496
00:24:35,512 --> 00:24:37,112
- You... - It's only a matter of time.

497
00:24:38,160 --> 00:24:39,640
Aunt Lingxiao is too busy for you now,

498
00:24:39,784 --> 00:24:41,864
but she'll write to summon you back soon enough.

499
00:24:42,680 --> 00:24:44,640
Men must wed, and women must marry.

500
00:24:45,119 --> 00:24:46,440
You can't escape it.

501
00:24:47,960 --> 00:24:49,079
You'd better plan ahead.

502
00:24:49,720 --> 00:24:50,480
Or sooner or later,

503
00:24:50,600 --> 00:24:52,216
your parents will lead you by the nose.

504
00:24:57,119 --> 00:24:57,720
Tomorrow,

505
00:24:58,160 --> 00:24:59,799
Lanxiang and I are going on an outing.

506
00:25:00,240 --> 00:25:01,519
No need to prepare meals for us.

507
00:25:02,200 --> 00:25:02,880
All right.

508
00:25:03,160 --> 00:25:03,960
I'll come, too.

509
00:25:04,160 --> 00:25:05,200
I'm bored stiff at home.

510
00:25:06,872 --> 00:25:07,720
You're not coming.

511
00:25:10,559 --> 00:25:11,240
Jinqi!

512
00:25:12,400 --> 00:25:13,119
Lanxiang!

513
00:25:18,359 --> 00:25:20,160
Jinlan, Suhua.

514
00:25:21,319 --> 00:25:23,519
Wherever we go, you're not coming.

515
00:25:23,839 --> 00:25:24,480
You...

516
00:25:29,079 --> 00:25:30,039
Fine, don't take me.

517
00:25:32,000 --> 00:25:33,720
You just want me married off.

518
00:25:34,039 --> 00:25:34,920
Not a chance.

519
00:25:53,359 --> 00:25:53,960
This way.

520
00:25:58,359 --> 00:25:59,079
Careful.

521
00:26:14,824 --> 00:26:15,960
We've walked all this way,

522
00:26:15,970 --> 00:26:18,190
and you've beaten the grass all along. Aren't you tired?

523
00:26:18,550 --> 00:26:20,040
Beating the grass scares off snakes.

524
00:26:20,720 --> 00:26:21,400
Tiring as it is,

525
00:26:21,400 --> 00:26:23,559
it's better than a venomous snake bite.

526
00:26:27,256 --> 00:26:28,680
Young Master, what made you think

527
00:26:29,000 --> 00:26:30,680
of coming somewhere so remote to unwind?

528
00:26:31,799 --> 00:26:32,759
To visit an old friend.

529
00:26:34,839 --> 00:26:35,799
Why would your friend

530
00:26:36,279 --> 00:26:37,880
live somewhere so remote?

531
00:27:08,872 --> 00:27:10,440
Young Master, do you know that woman?

532
00:27:12,839 --> 00:27:13,640
I've seen her.

533
00:27:15,559 --> 00:27:16,759
She didn't recognize you.

534
00:27:20,480 --> 00:27:21,240
I've seen her.

535
00:27:22,079 --> 00:27:22,960
She's never seen me.

536
00:27:50,480 --> 00:27:51,240
We're here.

537
00:27:52,880 --> 00:27:54,559
This is the old friend I came to visit.

538
00:28:06,200 --> 00:28:07,119
This is

539
00:28:07,279 --> 00:28:08,079
a grave?

540
00:28:12,759 --> 00:28:14,160
A family grave.

541
00:28:14,839 --> 00:28:15,960
A family of twenty

542
00:28:17,079 --> 00:28:18,319
all buried here.

543
00:28:32,160 --> 00:28:33,079
Why does this grave

544
00:28:33,240 --> 00:28:34,640
have no headstone?

545
00:28:37,672 --> 00:28:38,984
Grand Secretary Shen's family,

546
00:28:39,016 --> 00:28:41,020
for deceiving the throne and betraying its favor,

547
00:28:41,030 --> 00:28:42,310
and for disloyalty to the state,

548
00:28:43,320 --> 00:28:45,000
was ordered to die by the late Emperor.

549
00:28:47,900 --> 00:28:52,180
♪Spring slips from the branches once more♪

550
00:28:54,860 --> 00:28:59,220
♪Flowers bloom unseen, as they have before♪

551
00:29:00,720 --> 00:29:02,039
Those who buried them

552
00:29:03,960 --> 00:29:05,359
didn't dare put up a headstone.

553
00:29:05,740 --> 00:29:08,180
♪While loss leaves winter in the heart♪

554
00:29:08,620 --> 00:29:10,980
♪Though all the world may fade♪

555
00:29:10,980 --> 00:29:13,860
♪Time rolls on as countless lives rush by♪

556
00:29:15,580 --> 00:29:20,140
♪Night winds wander through the halls of long ago♪

557
00:29:22,660 --> 00:29:27,060
♪No page could hold the longing words can never show♪

558
00:29:28,740 --> 00:29:32,460
♪Every joy and sorrow in this fleeting life♪

559
00:29:33,140 --> 00:29:35,700
♪Fades into the past as new wounds rise♪

560
00:29:36,820 --> 00:29:42,460
♪While whispers of perfume linger beneath the eaves♪

561
00:29:43,060 --> 00:29:47,140
♪Let the cold wind rage, let the wild rain fall♪

562
00:29:47,140 --> 00:29:50,300
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

563
00:29:50,300 --> 00:29:54,180
♪Let love fall to pieces, let old anger burn away♪

564
00:29:54,180 --> 00:29:56,980
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

565
00:29:56,980 --> 00:30:01,300
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

566
00:30:01,300 --> 00:30:04,300
♪And silver moonlight to guide me through the night♪

567
00:30:04,300 --> 00:30:08,140
♪Let beginnings fade as endings come to call♪

568
00:30:08,140 --> 00:30:12,460
♪From this endless dream, there's no return at all♪

569
00:30:17,839 --> 00:30:18,519
Jialan,

570
00:30:19,000 --> 00:30:20,440
we promised to meet no matter what.

571
00:30:20,440 --> 00:30:21,680
I've waited so long for you.

572
00:30:24,340 --> 00:30:28,820
♪Let the cold wind rage, let the wild rain fall♪

573
00:30:28,820 --> 00:30:31,900
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

574
00:30:31,900 --> 00:30:35,820
♪Let love fall to pieces, let old anger burn away♪

575
00:30:35,820 --> 00:30:38,160
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

576
00:30:38,160 --> 00:30:39,000
Jialan.

577
00:30:39,000 --> 00:30:42,980
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

578
00:30:42,980 --> 00:30:45,980
♪And silver moonlight to guide me through the night♪

579
00:30:45,980 --> 00:30:50,060
♪Let beginnings fade as endings come to call♪

580
00:30:50,060 --> 00:30:54,480
♪From this endless dream, there's no return at all♪

581
00:30:54,480 --> 00:30:56,039
Sorry, I've come too late.

582
00:31:02,559 --> 00:31:03,279
What's wrong?

583
00:31:05,720 --> 00:31:06,440
What's wrong?

584
00:31:07,319 --> 00:31:08,039
Are you all right?

585
00:31:22,799 --> 00:31:24,119
I've been searching

586
00:31:25,480 --> 00:31:27,200
for where the Shen family was buried.

587
00:31:28,720 --> 00:31:29,480
I never thought

588
00:31:30,240 --> 00:31:31,240
it would be here.

589
00:31:34,920 --> 00:31:36,079
You knew the Shen family?

590
00:31:43,079 --> 00:31:44,519
Back when I was in the capital,

591
00:31:46,480 --> 00:31:47,799
I was gravely ill, near death.

592
00:31:48,960 --> 00:31:50,839
To pay for my treatment,

593
00:31:51,519 --> 00:31:53,400
my parents had spent all their savings.

594
00:31:54,920 --> 00:31:57,359
Penniless and out of options,

595
00:31:58,279 --> 00:32:01,440
we chanced upon First Madam Shen and Young Lady Shen.

596
00:32:04,720 --> 00:32:07,000
The First Madam gave my parents ten taels of silver.

597
00:32:09,279 --> 00:32:11,319
The Young Lady gave me a set of clothes.

598
00:32:35,160 --> 00:32:36,799
What a twist of fate.

599
00:32:38,720 --> 00:32:40,240
You actually met Young Lady Shen.

600
00:32:51,119 --> 00:32:52,960
I humbly thank First Madam Shen

601
00:32:53,480 --> 00:32:54,519
and Young Lady Shen

602
00:32:55,160 --> 00:32:56,759
for the kindness you showed my wife.

603
00:33:11,039 --> 00:33:12,000
How did you know

604
00:33:12,640 --> 00:33:14,200
the Shen family was buried here?

605
00:33:17,079 --> 00:33:18,799
The Young Lady Shen who gave you clothes

606
00:33:19,920 --> 00:33:20,920
was named Shen Jialan.

607
00:33:22,640 --> 00:33:24,039
She was once betrothed to me.

608
00:33:27,359 --> 00:33:28,920
After the Shen family fell,

609
00:33:30,200 --> 00:33:32,200
to protect my family's lives,

610
00:33:33,440 --> 00:33:35,200
we had to break off the engagement.

611
00:33:39,559 --> 00:33:41,240
I felt guilty and couldn't rest.

612
00:33:42,920 --> 00:33:43,920
So I paid handsomely

613
00:33:44,072 --> 00:33:45,310
for the public burial ground

614
00:33:45,920 --> 00:33:48,160
to gather the Shen family's remains

615
00:33:49,680 --> 00:33:50,799
and bury them here.

616
00:33:53,519 --> 00:33:55,119
I also worried that over time

617
00:33:55,640 --> 00:33:57,200
it would become a wild wasteland.

618
00:33:58,480 --> 00:33:59,400
So when

619
00:33:59,920 --> 00:34:01,839
the officials sold the Shen servants,

620
00:34:03,160 --> 00:34:03,920
I had someone

621
00:34:04,359 --> 00:34:06,440
buy back Madam Sun and Qiukui

622
00:34:07,839 --> 00:34:09,360
and helped them become free commoners.

623
00:34:10,119 --> 00:34:11,400
Madam Sun?

624
00:34:12,360 --> 00:34:13,400
Qiukui?

625
00:34:22,039 --> 00:34:23,599
It was Qiukui back then

626
00:34:24,920 --> 00:34:26,079
who gave me the clothes.

627
00:34:26,800 --> 00:34:27,920
I've always remembered her.

628
00:34:32,840 --> 00:34:34,079
You saw her not long ago.

629
00:34:38,199 --> 00:34:39,199
That woman

630
00:34:39,559 --> 00:34:40,559
was Qiukui?

631
00:34:45,559 --> 00:34:46,920
She goes by Li Sanniang now.

632
00:34:48,119 --> 00:34:49,800
She married the village carpenter.

633
00:34:50,440 --> 00:34:51,440
Now she's

634
00:34:52,599 --> 00:34:54,280
a mother of two sons and a daughter.

635
00:34:58,360 --> 00:34:59,239
Today

636
00:35:00,719 --> 00:35:01,880
we came face to face,

637
00:35:03,320 --> 00:35:04,719
yet she didn't know me.

638
00:35:10,599 --> 00:35:11,880
Many years have passed.

639
00:35:12,920 --> 00:35:14,400
It's normal not to recognize you.

640
00:35:16,199 --> 00:35:17,480
As long as she's living well.

641
00:35:22,840 --> 00:35:23,719
Yes.

642
00:35:28,079 --> 00:35:30,519
If Young Lady Shen can see from beyond,

643
00:35:32,119 --> 00:35:33,400
she can rest in peace.

644
00:35:38,119 --> 00:35:38,719
Today

645
00:35:40,400 --> 00:35:41,840
is Shen Jialan's birthday.

646
00:35:43,840 --> 00:35:45,039
I brought you here

647
00:35:46,519 --> 00:35:48,159
first, to pay respects to an old friend.

648
00:35:49,320 --> 00:35:50,400
Birthday?

649
00:35:52,360 --> 00:35:53,239
Today is...

650
00:35:54,800 --> 00:35:55,760
Birthday...

651
00:36:00,320 --> 00:36:01,079
Yes.

652
00:36:03,880 --> 00:36:05,559
Today is the 18th day of the 7th month.

653
00:36:07,960 --> 00:36:08,840
It is...

654
00:36:11,400 --> 00:36:13,440
It is Young Lady Shen's birthday.

655
00:36:20,039 --> 00:36:21,039
I'd forgotten.

656
00:36:22,920 --> 00:36:24,159
You still remembered.

657
00:36:30,400 --> 00:36:32,199
Though Shen Jialan and I were betrothed,

658
00:36:33,039 --> 00:36:34,159
we never met.

659
00:36:37,079 --> 00:36:37,920
It's just that

660
00:36:40,000 --> 00:36:41,760
I could never let it go.

661
00:36:45,920 --> 00:36:46,719
The Lin family

662
00:36:47,960 --> 00:36:49,320
wronged the Shen family.

663
00:36:51,480 --> 00:36:52,000
I...

664
00:36:55,239 --> 00:36:56,320
failed Shen Jialan.

665
00:36:58,119 --> 00:36:59,000
I...

666
00:37:01,239 --> 00:37:02,320
am truly no good husband.

667
00:37:04,000 --> 00:37:05,119
(Heaven above)

668
00:37:05,752 --> 00:37:07,110
(and Earth below bear witness.)

669
00:37:08,159 --> 00:37:10,960
(A righteous man gathered the remains)

670
00:37:11,199 --> 00:37:13,519
(of the Shen family and Lanxiang,)

671
00:37:15,159 --> 00:37:16,719
(and laid them to rest.)

672
00:37:18,679 --> 00:37:19,920
(For such great kindness,)

673
00:37:21,000 --> 00:37:22,639
(I'll never forget its source)

674
00:37:23,679 --> 00:37:25,480
(and will repay it even beyond death.)

675
00:37:30,159 --> 00:37:30,880
You said

676
00:37:31,679 --> 00:37:33,199
first, to honor an old friend.

677
00:37:34,719 --> 00:37:35,440
What's the second?

678
00:37:43,360 --> 00:37:44,159
Second,

679
00:37:46,440 --> 00:37:47,639
I want you to know

680
00:37:49,519 --> 00:37:50,760
what kind of man

681
00:37:52,159 --> 00:37:53,880
the husband you married truly is.

682
00:37:56,159 --> 00:37:57,119
The good

683
00:37:58,280 --> 00:37:59,199
and the bad,

684
00:38:00,519 --> 00:38:01,760
I want you to know it all.

685
00:38:04,559 --> 00:38:05,559
You once said

686
00:38:07,000 --> 00:38:08,199
our ways are different.

687
00:38:10,559 --> 00:38:11,519
I want to know

688
00:38:13,320 --> 00:38:14,119
where my way

689
00:38:17,320 --> 00:38:18,800
truly differs from yours.

690
00:38:22,408 --> 00:38:23,480
The person I've wronged most

691
00:38:25,000 --> 00:38:27,000
in this life is buried here.

692
00:38:28,639 --> 00:38:29,639
The thing I've done

693
00:38:29,639 --> 00:38:31,159
that I could never tell anyone

694
00:38:31,159 --> 00:38:32,039
is here, too.

695
00:38:37,840 --> 00:38:38,880
I'm no gentleman.

696
00:38:41,000 --> 00:38:41,880
I get scared.

697
00:38:43,079 --> 00:38:44,000
I act rashly.

698
00:38:46,239 --> 00:38:48,159
I may even do things deemed treasonous.

699
00:38:52,119 --> 00:38:53,639
But in this life,

700
00:38:56,639 --> 00:38:57,679
I will never fail you.

701
00:39:05,820 --> 00:39:08,580
♪The golden sunset♪

702
00:39:08,580 --> 00:39:11,900
♪sketches my thoughts♪

703
00:39:13,580 --> 00:39:16,180
♪All things fall silent,♪

704
00:39:16,180 --> 00:39:19,500
♪fearing to disturb this moment♪

705
00:39:20,340 --> 00:39:23,380
♪My restless heart♪

706
00:39:23,740 --> 00:39:27,420
♪seeks a place to anchor♪

707
00:39:27,820 --> 00:39:33,740
♪I wonder if the past has ever been heard♪

708
00:39:40,239 --> 00:39:41,039
(Father.)

709
00:39:42,440 --> 00:39:43,159
(Mother.)

710
00:39:45,760 --> 00:39:47,559
(You heard what he said, too?)

711
00:39:54,280 --> 00:39:55,280
Come with me,

712
00:39:56,480 --> 00:39:56,960
and before

713
00:39:59,360 --> 00:40:00,360
my savior,

714
00:40:01,239 --> 00:40:02,239
kowtow three times.

715
00:40:04,000 --> 00:40:04,960
Then I'll tell you

716
00:40:06,239 --> 00:40:07,000
how your way

717
00:40:08,239 --> 00:40:09,119
and my way

718
00:40:10,119 --> 00:40:11,119
differ.

719
00:40:14,840 --> 00:40:15,880
Not just three.

720
00:40:18,320 --> 00:40:19,519
Three hundred, if you like.

721
00:40:28,300 --> 00:40:31,220
♪I no longer blame the moon♪

722
00:40:31,220 --> 00:40:33,519
♪For withholding its light♪

723
00:40:33,519 --> 00:40:35,719
(First, bow to Heaven and Earth.)

724
00:40:36,140 --> 00:40:39,620
♪I only pray that those I've known♪

725
00:40:39,620 --> 00:40:43,740
♪Still live and thrive♪

726
00:40:43,740 --> 00:40:48,140
♪No longer let the world's wind and snow fall♪

727
00:40:48,140 --> 00:40:50,740
♪And leave the grass and trees covered in frost♪

728
00:40:51,480 --> 00:40:53,639
(Second, bow to the parents.)

729
00:40:55,540 --> 00:40:59,020
♪You and I will walk there together♪

730
00:40:59,020 --> 00:41:02,420
♪I no longer search through old dreams♪

731
00:41:02,420 --> 00:41:05,740
♪Leaving them buried deep within the years♪

732
00:41:08,860 --> 00:41:11,039
(Husband and wife, bow to each other.)

733
00:41:11,039 --> 00:41:13,820
♪Toward where my heart leads♪

734
00:41:14,020 --> 00:41:18,340
♪I no longer lament that fate is hard to foresee♪

735
00:41:18,340 --> 00:41:21,580
♪Accepting the unexpected as ordinary♪

736
00:41:21,580 --> 00:41:25,540
♪I only wish the road behind us would fade like mist♪

737
00:41:25,540 --> 00:41:30,780
♪And we would share the road home♪

738
00:41:41,039 --> 00:41:44,400
♪The beacon fires of Yumen die out♪

739
00:41:44,960 --> 00:41:48,800
♪Qiuci's drums and horns fall still♪

740
00:41:49,920 --> 00:41:53,880
♪Alas, alas♪

741
00:41:56,960 --> 00:42:02,480
♪Glory is bought with battlefield blood♪

742
00:42:02,519 --> 00:42:03,840
Didn't you write a new play

743
00:42:03,840 --> 00:42:04,840
to be staged?

744
00:42:05,280 --> 00:42:06,519
Why is it just the two of us?

745
00:42:08,199 --> 00:42:09,320
Because this play

746
00:42:09,960 --> 00:42:11,079
was written only for you,

747
00:42:11,920 --> 00:42:12,920
for your eyes alone.

748
00:42:32,800 --> 00:42:34,159
Didn't you want to know

749
00:42:35,760 --> 00:42:36,960
how our ways

750
00:42:37,679 --> 00:42:38,840
differ?

751
00:43:05,300 --> 00:43:07,460
=Against the Current= (Next Episode's Preview)

752
00:43:08,000 --> 00:43:11,920
Sunlight bright, and moonlight bright.

753
00:43:12,000 --> 00:43:15,559
Red candles flicker, and blossoms are sweet.

754
00:43:16,480 --> 00:43:21,880
Hand in hand, we laugh as one, a pair of mandarin ducks.

755
00:43:22,599 --> 00:43:26,039
Unafraid of the world's wind and frost.

756
00:43:26,440 --> 00:43:30,039
Face to face, dawn to dusk, love endures.

757
00:43:47,300 --> 00:43:51,420
♪Spring slips from the branches once more♪

758
00:43:54,260 --> 00:43:58,780
♪Flowers bloom unseen, as they have before♪

759
00:44:00,060 --> 00:44:03,980
♪All the joys and sorrows come and go♪

760
00:44:04,660 --> 00:44:07,420
♪While loss leaves winter in the heart♪

761
